       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DATEDIFFDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 START-DATE PIC 9(8) VALUE 20240101.
       01 END-DATE   PIC 9(8) VALUE 20240315.
       01 START-INTEGER PIC 9(7).
       01 END-INTEGER   PIC 9(7).
       01 DAY-DIFFERENCE PIC S9(5).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE START-INTEGER =
               FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE(START-DATE)
           COMPUTE END-INTEGER =
               FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE(END-DATE)
           COMPUTE DAY-DIFFERENCE = END-INTEGER - START-INTEGER

           DISPLAY "DAYS BETWEEN DATES: " DAY-DIFFERENCE
           STOP RUN.
